  "description": "Themia one-time challenge core — issues a secret bound to an opaque key, verifies it exactly once, and enforces TTL, attempt caps and two layers of rate limiting. Serves phone OTP, email OTP, magic links, email verification and password reset. No SMS, email, user or framework dependency.",
